{
  "name": "Nate Mills Design System",
  "description": "The published CSS class API of natemills.me as data: every public class, its kind, its own selectors, the states (pseudo-classes) and parts (pseudo-elements) they cover, the descendant rules that style its insides, the custom properties its own rules read and set, and a minimal example for each component group that has one. Link the stylesheets in this order. Anything not listed here is a portfolio internal: the unpublished list on each class names the classes its selectors mention that are not part of this API (site hooks and parts a script adds), so never write one. Generated by portfolio/tokens/componentsjson.mjs from design-system/components.css, the class roster in designmd.manifest.js and the link block in DESIGN.md; do not edit.",
